  "content": {
    "original": [
      "茅檐低小",
      "溪上青青草",
      "醉里吴音相媚好",
      "白发谁家翁媪",
      "大儿锄豆溪东",
      "中儿正织鸡笼",
      "最喜小儿亡赖",
      "溪头卧剥莲蓬"
    ],
    "translation": [
      "a low thatched eave",
      "green grass beside the stream",
      "drunk, the old couple tease each other in soft wu speech",
      "whose white-haired man and wife are these",
      "the eldest son hoes beans east of the stream",
      "the middle son is weaving a chicken coop",
      "i love best the youngest, the little rascal",
      "lying at the stream's head, peeling lotus pods"
    ],
