  "annotations": {},
  "appreciation": "Xin Qiji, usually the poet of war and frustration, here writes a warm genre scene: a thatched cottage, a stream, and a family busy at its small tasks. The drunken old couple joking in dialect and the youngest child peeling lotus pods give the poem its affection. It is a rare picture of peace from a poet who rarely had it.",
